OL,3,GNEWSAKing's path could be moved to save
OL,4,Acaravans                               
OL,6,FPlans to safeguard dozens of caravans  
OL,7,Ffrom coastal erosion at a site in East 
OL,8,FYorkshire could see part of the King   
OL,9,FCharles III England Coast Path         
OL,10,Frerouted.                              
OL,12,FSkirlington Leisure Park has proposed  
OL,13,Fmoving 90 caravans at its site in      
OL,14,FSkipsea inland to protect them.        
OL,16,FIf the proposals are approved, the     
OL,17,Fcoastal path could to be moved slightly
OL,18,Finland for a short distance.           
OL,20,FThe plans will be considered by East   
OL,21,FRiding of Yorkshire Council.           
